{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2021-04-27 17:00:00', 'title': "COMERICA DECLARES DIVIDENDS; ANNOUNCES INCREASE IN SHARE REPURCHASE AUTHORIZATION AND RESULTS FROM ANNUAL SHAREHOLDERS' MEETING", 'text': 'DALLAS, APRIL 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0COMERICA INCORPORATED (NYSE: CMA) ANNOUNCED ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND FOR COMMON STOCK OF 68 CENTS ($0.68) PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JULY 1, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JUNE 15, 2021.'}